@startuml Manager Manage Room Sequence
title Sequence Diagram: Quản lý Phòng & Sơ đồ ghế (Manager)
skinparam theme cerulean

actor Manager
boundary "manage-rooms.html" as UI
control "RoomController" as Ctrl
entity "RoomService" as Svc
entity "SeatService" as SeatSvc
database "MySQL" as DB

Manager -> UI: Nhập tên phòng, số hàng, số cột
UI -> Ctrl: POST /api/rooms (RoomRequest)
activate Ctrl

Ctrl -> Svc: createRoomWithSeats(roomRequest)
activate Svc

Svc -> DB: save(roomEntity)
activate DB
DB --> Svc: roomEntity (with ID)
deactivate DB

note right of Svc: Tự động sinh danh sách ghế\ndựa trên hàng (A, B...) và cột (1, 2...)
Svc -> SeatSvc: generateSeatsForRoom(roomEntity)
activate SeatSvc
SeatSvc -> DB: saveAll(seatList)
activate DB
DB --> SeatSvc: success
deactivate DB
SeatSvc --> Svc: success
deactivate SeatSvc

Svc --> Ctrl: roomResponseDto
deactivate Svc

Ctrl --> UI: 201 Created
deactivate Ctrl
UI -> Manager: Hiển thị sơ đồ ghế vừa tạo
@enduml
